OL,3,GNEWSAWhy Pride is facing a backlash -
OL,4,Afrom inside and outside the LGBT
OL,5,Acommunity
OL,6,
OL,7,FFor Matt, it was a significant
OL,8,Fhomecoming. "It really took me back to
OL,9,Fwhen I was a kid growing up here,
OL,10,Ftrying to navigate my identity. It felt
OL,11,Fso important to be there and see how a
OL,12,Ftown that wasn't particularly
OL,13,Fwelcoming... has changed and
OL,14,Fflourished."
